  "excerpt": "In our 60th year of working to save sight, we hope support for QEI's research and education programs will continue. Please give generously this June.",
  "body_html": "<h1>Give the gift of sight in June</h1>\n<h3>Make a tax-deductible donation today to support Queensland’s largest independent eye health research institute.</h3>\n<h2><a href=\"../../qei-foundation/donate/index.html\">Click here to donate</a></h2>\n<p>This year the Queensland Eye Institute (QEI) Foundation celebrates 60 years of fundraising to support eye health research and education in Australia.<br/>\nEstablished in April 1965 as the Prevent Blindness Foundation (Queensland Division), the QEI Foundation has built a reputation as one of Queensland’s most trusted charities, raising money to pay QEI scientists and buy research equipment and supplies.</p>\n<p>From humble beginnings in a room at the Princess Alexandra Hospital, the Queensland Eye Institute now operates from a custom-built clinical and research campus in Woolloongabba. Highly skilled ophthalmologists work with research scientists and a clinical trial team towards future cures, while offering advanced treatment options to all Australians.</p>\n<p>In our 60th year of working to save sight, community support for QEI’s research and education programs is more important than ever. Please give generously.</p>\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\"><img alt=\"Six snapshot images of fundraising events over the years including Christmas markets, fun runs, fashion parades, sausage sizzles and art auctions.\" class=\"aligncenter wp-image-5852 size-full\" data-warning=\"Suspicious alt text\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"180\" sizes=\"(max-width: 740px) 100vw, 740px\" src=\"../../wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Fundraising-banner.png\" srcset=\"../../wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Fundraising-banner.png 740w, ../../wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Fundraising-banner-300x73.png 300w, ../../wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Fundraising-banner-400x97.png 400w\" width=\"740\"/></div>\n<h2>Donate now</h2>\n<p>Call us on <strong>3239 5050</strong> to donate over the phone or online using the form below.</p>\n<div class=\"gf_browser_unknown gform_wrapper gform_legacy_markup_wrapper gform-theme--no-framework donate-foms_wrapper\" data-form-index=\"0\" data-form-theme=\"legacy\" id=\"gform_wrapper_9\">\n<div class=\"gform_heading\">\n<p class=\"gform_description\"></p>\n</div><form action=\"#\" aria-disabled=\"true\" autocomplete=\"off\" class=\"donate-foms\" data-formid=\"9\" data-original-action=\"index.html\" data-original-method=\"post\" data-qei-static-form=\"disabled\" enctype=\"multipart/form-data\" id=\"gform_9\" method=\"get\" novalidate=\"novalidate\" onsubmit=\"return false\">\n<div class=\"gform-body gform_body\"><ul class=\"gform_fields top_label form_sublabel_below description_below validation_below\" id=\"gform_fields_9\"><li class=\"gfield gfield--type-radio gfield--type-choice donation-tabs hide-label gfield_contains_required field_sublabel_below gfield--no-description field_description_below field_validation_below gfield_visibility_visible\" id=\"field_9_1\"><label class=\"gfield_label gform-field-label\">Donate types<span class=\"gfield_required\"><span class=\"gfield_required gfield_required_asterisk\">*</span></span></label><div class=\"ginput_container ginput_container_radio\"><ul class=\"gfield_radio\" id=\"input_9_1\">\n<li class=\"gchoice gchoice_9_1_0\">\n<input aria-disabled=\"true\" checked=\"checked\" data-original-name=\"input_1\" disabled=\"disabled\" id=\"choice_9_1_0\" tabindex=\"-1\" type=\"radio\" value=\"Donate Once\"/>\n<label class=\"gform-field-label gform-field-label--type-inline\" for=\"choice_9_1_0\" id=\"label_9_1_0\">Donate Once</label>\n</li>\n<li class=\"gchoice gchoice_9_1_1\">\n<input aria-disabled=\"true\" data-original-name=\"input_1\" disabled=\"disabled\" id=\"choice_9_1_1\" tabindex=\"-1\" type=\"radio\" value=\"Donate Monthly\"/>\n<label class=\"gform-field-label gform-field-label--type-inline\" for=\"choice_9_1_1\" id=\"label_9_1_1\">Donate Monthly</label>\n</li></ul></div></li><li class=\"gfield gfield--type-product gfield