d=\"true\" data-original-name=\"ak_js\" disabled=\"disabled\" id=\"ak_js_1\" tabindex=\"-1\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"\"/>\n</p></form>\n</div>\n<h3>Your tax-deductible gift allows the QEI Foundation to invest in people and programs addressing preventable blindness. Your donation directly funds QEI researchers and scientists, giving long-term certainty in their fight to save sight.</h3>",
